      "coverage_note": "Scaleup Europe Fund’s €5 billion is a target, not a final close or current assets-under-management figure; the European Commission’s €1 billion is its disclosed contribution. The fund is managed by EQT, while other public and private investors participate as investors. EUCLYD’s September 2026 announcement reports a €200 million-plus company-wide Series A co-led by the fund; the fund’s individual commitment was not disclosed. EQT’s fund page describes the mandate and target but does not disclose an operating balance or individual investments.",
      "summary": "Scaleup Europe Fund 是由 EQT 管理、并获欧盟委员会及机构投资者支持的欧洲成长及后期科技基金。其目标规模为 €5 billion，专注于从 B 轮至 pre-IPO 阶段的战略技术。2026 年 9 月，EUCLYD 宣布完成由该基金联合领投的 €200 million-plus A 轮融资；未披露个别承诺金额。",
